# Copy this file to web/.dev.vars for local Worker proxy development.
# It is a reference/placeholder file only and must never contain production
# credentials. web/.dev.vars is gitignored; keep real values out of Git.
#
# The transitional Worker `/api/v1/rpc` proxy forwards domain RPCs to an Apps
# Script deployment's /exec URL. Replace the placeholder with the isolated
# Apps Script versioned deployment's /exec URL (never the production
# deployment). Prefer `wrangler secret put APPS_SCRIPT_EXEC_URL` for anything
# beyond a throwaway prototype.
APPS_SCRIPT_EXEC_URL="https://script.google.com/macros/s/REPLACE_WITH_ISOLATED_APPS_SCRIPT_EXEC_URL/exec"